antees retaining the initiative (unless bombed) and sets up a winning endgame where the player can subsequently use the 3333 either as a bomb or as a "four with two pairs" kicker to discard the remaining small pairs (55, 66).\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♦8", "♦9", "♣10", "♣J", "♠Q", "♠K", "♦A"]}'}
